Answers to commonly asked questions about Dave:

To dance for Dave, you need:

1 day of age.
120 stats.

You also cannot have danced for Dave since the last time he was released.
Thus, one mortal cannot effectively dance a zillion times.

What happens when you dance for Dave:

You lose 4 of each stat.
Your hp, mana, and ftg goes to 1.

This happens whether or not Dave listens to your request.  Thus, if
you dance for Dave even though you've danced for him since the last
time he was released, you still lose the stats.

What happens to the person Dave goes after.

They get killed.
Their inventory is dested.
They lose their will to continue (Willpower -> 1).

A certain amount of time, Dave will go after someone else once he is released.
